                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "LOL. They got the anchor promos wrong this morning and were saying from the San Francisco Free Press. I slacked the anchor then Judy and got in changed. The pre-recorded promos by Alexis this morning were correct, but I suspect they were responding to my annoyance about the Free Press thing."
